          "abridged": false,
          "description": "In the magical town of Flutterfax, the Greasy Wand café is beloved for its chaos—fighting pastries, mixed-up potions, and meals that misbehave. When its clumsy but lovable wizard owners are nominated for a prestigious award, they try to fix their flaws and lose what made them special. A whimsical tale about magic, misfits, and learning that perfection isn’t always the goal.",
